```mdl
decision D-120: The project's repositories are the `Repo.RepositoriesAnnotation` on it, an ordered list of repository refs defined beside `Repo`, and `Project` 0.8.0 has no repository field. The first repository takes over `repo`'s role: bare issue numbers resolve against it, and a cloud coding agent starts in it. plugin-claude renders the list in the project's settings. Fills in [D-119] and [D-45].
